<title>JAPAN: TSE says seeks to list Satori Electric.</title>
<headline>TSE says seeks to list Satori Electric.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Thursday that it applied to the Finance Ministry for approval to list shares of Satori Electric Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Satori Electric, a wholesaler of electric components, is likely to be listed on the second section of the TSE on March 12 and plans to sell 800,000 shares, the TSE said.</p>
<p>Satori Electric's shares are currently traded on the over-the-counter (OTC) market.</p>
